{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO DISJOINED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISJOINED is an indie RPG that takes place after every other adventure has been completed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control Wynn, a soulless being in the only thing left: <strong>The Infinite Mall at the End of Time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE INFINITE MALL AT THE END OF TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the many services provided to you by the Mall, including but not limited to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tea</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porridge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Printing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relic Stores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Relicsmiths&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emergency Exits! (TO ONLY BE USED DURING AN EMERGENCY.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What a wide selection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943580/extras/b9d5c37ba0739fa7c208d497a2c21f75.avif?t=1761684461\" width=1560 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mall is filled with people like yourself, looking for a spark to keep them going. Spread across them are<i> relics</i>, ancient items from the stories of the past. Collect them, and use the energy stored inside to battle others and regrow the roots of time. With each new layer of time comes new characters, events, and opportunities for adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future is as bleak as it could possibly be. In fact, there is no future written. But maybe, just maybe... you could change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi